### Önce giriş yap (normal kullanıcı da olur), token'ı al
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shop.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = BURAYA_ACCESS_TOKEN

# ============ SEPET ============

### Sepeti getir (boşsa otomatik oluşur)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sepete ekle (önce GET /products ile bir variantId al)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "variantId": "BURAYA_VARIANT_ID",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Stok aşımı denemesi (çok yüksek adet - 400 dönmeli)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "variantId": "BURAYA_VARIANT_ID",
  "quantity": 999
}

### Kalem adedini güncelle
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/BURAYA_ITEM_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Kalemi kaldır
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart/items/BURAYA_ITEM_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sepeti boşalt
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ============ ADRESLER ============

### Adresleri listele
GET http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Adres ekle
POST http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Ev",
  "fullName": "Ali Veli",
  "phone": "05551234567",
  "city": "Bursa",
  "district": "Nilüfer",
  "fullAddress": "Örnek mahallesi, 123. sokak, No:4 D:5",
  "zipCode": "16110",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Adres güncelle
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/BURAYA_ADRES_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "İş"
}

### Adres sil
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/BURAYA_ADRES_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
